        <briefdescription>
<para>Generate a Kubernetes CronJob manifest in JSON format for a single task. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The manifest represents a <computeroutput>batch/v1 CronJob</computeroutput> resource that, on each trigger, runs a pod which calls POST {themisdb_base_url}/api/v1/scheduler/tasks/{task.id}/execute</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>task</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>ThemisDB scheduled task to export. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>config</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Kubernetes generation options (namespace, image, auth, …). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>JSON object representing the Kubernetes CronJob manifest.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::invalid_argument</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
