        <detaileddescription>
<para>Interval To Cron.</para>
<para>Intervals shorter than 1 minute are rounded up to 1 minute. Intervals shorter than 1 hour are expressed as <computeroutput>*\/N * * * *</computeroutput>. Intervals shorter than 24 hours are expressed as <computeroutput>0 *\/N * * *</computeroutput>. Daily or longer intervals are expressed as <computeroutput>0 0 *\/D * *</computeroutput>.</para>
